    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dĭaerĕsis</span></b> , is,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίρεσις</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gram., <i>the
				dividing of one syllable into two</i>, as aquaï 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">for aquae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. A. 7, 464</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			rhet., a figure, pure Lat. distributio, <i>distribution</i>, Jul. <i><span class="en">Rufin. 21, p.
			242</span></i>.</div>
